* Ideal P-channel MOSFET
* Ports: D G S
.SUBCKT IDEAL_PFET d g s PARAMS: Ron=0.1 Roff=1G Vth=1.0 Rg=1 Cgs=50p Cgd=10p Vf=0.7

* Gate network
Rg   g gi {Rg}
Cgs  gi s {Cgs}
Cgd  gi d {Cgd}
Rgs  gi s 1T

* Channel: on when V(s) - V(gi) > Vth
S1   d s s gi SWP

* Body diode (anode at drain, cathode at source)
Dbody d s DBODY

.MODEL SWP SW(Vt={Vth} Vh=0.3 Ron={Ron} Roff={Roff})
.MODEL DBODY D(IS=1e-12 N=1 RS=0.01 CJO=0)
.ENDS IDEAL_PFET
